  "title": "Kalman Delta Networks: Uncertainty-aware Associative Memory",
  "summary": "Kalman Delta Networks (KDNs) introduce a linear-attention model that explicitly tracks memory uncertainty, enabling efficient associative memory with logarithmic parallel depth. By balancing accumulated evidence against memory reliability, KDNs improve both perplexity and performance in robotic manipulation policies. These models support hardware-efficient training and inference with simplified architectures.",
